 ## Measured quality, usage and cost
 
-[Independent evaluation](evaluation-results.md) reports two of four strict heldout quality successes for investigation and one of four for the simple helper. Investigation improved initial-to-delivered support in the supported and missing-evidence cases, but the latter omitted the explicit action to obtain the missing signed decision and fails the strict stopping grade. The contradiction case stopped with no delivered answer. Its diagnostic candidate is not counted as a result. These are four related synthetic cases, not evidence of general superiority. All30 initial/final heldout citations are byte-valid; irrelevant references still provide no claim coverage.
